Journey: Rahul Shetty Academy practice page
Tags: @rahulshetty
Base URL: https://rahulshettyacademy.com

Open /AutomationPractice/
Check the Radio2 radio button
  Expect the Radio2 radio button is checked
Type "ind" into the Type to Select Countries field
Click the "India" text
  Expect the value of the Type to Select Countries field is "India"
Select "Option2" from the dropdown inside the "Dropdown Example" section
Check the Option3 checkbox
  Expect the Option3 checkbox is checked
Hover over the "Mouse Hover" button
Click the "Top" link
  Expect the URL contains "#top"
Type "Ada" into the Enter Your Name field
Accept the next alert
Click the "Alert" button
  Expect an alert saying "Hello Ada"
Type "Ada" into the Enter Your Name field
Dismiss the next confirm dialog
Click the "Confirm" button
  Expect a confirm dialog saying "Hello Ada, Are you sure you want to confirm?"
Click the "Hide" button
  Expect the Hide/Show Example field is hidden
Click the "Show" button
  Expect the Hide/Show Example field is visible
In frame "courses-iframe"
  Expect the page contains "An Academy to Learn Earn"
End
Click the "Open Tab" link and switch to the new tab
  Expect the URL contains "qaclickacademy"
Switch back to the main tab
Click the "Open Window" button and switch to the new window
  Expect there are 3 tabs open
Close the window
Expect the page contains "Web Table Example"
